description.desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Perform up to 4 consecutive attacks forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumiflux Attribute DMG</color>;
If a Basic Attack hits a target, the Character recovers <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> after the skill ends;
The 4th Basic Attack hit applies 1 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color> to the target.

Hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Perform a wide-range Slash forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumiflux Attribute DMG</color>;
If a target is hit, restore <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> for the Character after the skill ends.

When the Character has <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Round]</color> stored, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch a powerful large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumiflux Attribute DMG</color>;
If the attack hits a target, recover a large amount of <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> after the skill ends;
If the attack hits a target, trigger the <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:8+AvatarSkillLevel(0)*16,1,2}%</color>;
All stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Rounds]</color> will be cleared upon activation.

When the Character has stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Rounds]</color> and is in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Rank Up]</color> state, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch a powerful large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumiflux Attribute DMG</color>;
If the attack hits a target, the Character recovers a large amount of <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> after the skill ends;
If the attack hits a target, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect can be triggered after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:10+AvatarSkillLevel(0)*20,1,2}%</color>;
All stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Rounds]</color> will be cleared upon activation.

With enough Energy, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Upon entering the battlefield, if the user's Energy is below 60, restore it to 60. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger at most once every 180 seconds;
Launch a large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
After the skill ends, apply 2 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Points]</color> to hit enemies;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Hold <IconMap:Icon_Special> to activate:
Enter <color=#FFFFFF>[Shift Stance]</color> after a <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color>. While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Shift Stance]</color>, switching characters with <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> at the maximum of 120 points allows entry into <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color>:
In <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color>, the character acts autonomously to assist in combat. Some attacks can also apply <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Points]</color> to targets. <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> is consumed over time in <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color>, and when <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> is fully consumed, the character exits <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color>. Before exiting <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color>, the character can only be switched in via <color=#FFFFFF>[Chain Attack]</color>;
If the character triggers 3 <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute</color> <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation]</color> reactions while in <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color>, the character activates the <color=#FFFFFF>[Entrance Ultimate]</color>. Upon activation, Normal Switch-In is unlocked, and the character will automatically use <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: Entrance]</color> on the next Normal Switch-In;
Upon entering <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color>, the character grants all squad members a DMG increase of {CAL:0+AvatarSkillLevel(1)*1.5,1,2}% for 60s; repeated triggers reset the duration;
If the character's <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> reaches the maximum of 120 points and a <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> hits a Stunned enemy, switching characters during the <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[EX Special Attack]</color> can also trigger entry into <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color>;
If no character switch is made after entering <color=#FFFFFF>[Shift Stance]</color>, the character performs a downward attack to return to the ground.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Launches a multi-hit large area attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
Upon activation, enter <color=#FFFFFF>[Rank Up]</color> state, upgrading the next <color=#FFFFFF>[Maximum Firepower]</color> to <color=#FFFFFF>[True: Full-Barrage Launch]</color>;
After the skill ends, applies 2 <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Points]</color> to hit enemies;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Enter the field and unleash a large area bombardment, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
Consumes 40 <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> on activation. If remaining <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color> is below 90 when activated, this Entry Skill will not consume <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Energy]</color>, and the character enters <color=#FFFFFF>[Rank Up]</color> state — the next use of <color=#FFFFFF>[Maximum Firepower]</color> will be upgraded to <color=#FFFFFF>[True: Full-Barrage Launch]</color>;
When the skill hits an enemy in a Stunned state, the enemy's Stun duration is extended by 3 seconds. Each enemy can receive this effect only once per Stun;
If the skill hits a target, <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> can be triggered after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:10+AvatarSkillLevel(3)*20,1,2}%</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Perform a multi-hit attack forward, dealing <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute DMG</color>;
If the attack hits a target, trigger the <color=#FFFFFF>Luminize</color> effect after the skill ends, with a multiplier of <color=#2BAD00>{CAL:11+AvatarSkillLevel(3)*22,1,2}%</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

desc:
Remie's <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation Coefficient]</color> is <color=#2BAD00>0.04%</color> of her own Anomaly Proficiency;
When a teammate triggers a <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute</color> <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation]</color> reaction for the Character, the Character can store the Anomaly Pool after <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation]</color> as <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Rounds]</color>, storing up to the Anomaly Pools of the 3 most recently triggered Anomaly States;
If <color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: Entrance]</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>[Ultimate: Finale]</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>[Maximum Firepower]</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>[True: Full-Barrage Launch]</color> hits a target, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Luminize]</color> effect can be triggered after the skill ends:
Deal Attribute Anomaly DMG of all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Rounds]</color> at the skill's corresponding multiplier to enemies, and increase this DMG Multiplier based on <color=#2BAD00>0.2%</color> of her own Anomaly Proficiency;
When the Character enters <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color> or after triggering <color=#FFFFFF>[Maximum Firepower]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[True: Full-Barrage Launch]</color>, all stored <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly Rounds]</color> will be cleared.
(Note: <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation]</color> is a <color=#FFA9DD>Lumen Attribute</color> reaction. If an enemy has <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Points]</color>, when the enemy is about to enter an Attribute Anomaly State, then this Anomaly State will be <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutated]</color>. The Anomaly Pool of this Anomaly State will be amplified based on the <color=#FFFFFF>[Mutation Coefficient]</color> of the provider of <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Points]</color>, and the total DMG this Anomaly State can deal will increase accordingly.)

Triggers when another <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Character or same-Faction Character exists in your squad:
When the number of <color=#FFFFFF>[Anomaly]</color> Characters in your squad is 1/2/3, entering the battlefield boosts ATK for all squad members by 40% of Remie's initial ATK, with a cap of 300/600/1,600, and Daze dealt by this character in <color=#FFFFFF>[Flight Stance]</color> is increased by 7.5%/15%/35%;
Additionally, when this character applies <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color> to an enemy, it also inflicts the <color=#FFFFFF>[Fade]</color> effect on the enemy: while under the <color=#FFFFFF>[Fade]</color> effect, when the enemy takes Attribute Anomaly DMG, Anomaly Buildup is increased by 15%. When the enemy has no <color=#FFA9DD>[Lumen Buildup Point]</color>, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Fade]</color> effect expires.

